WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.826
Dafra ka jɛgɛ senumanw. Bobo-Dioulasso ka maana dɔ lo.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.728
K'a ta o wagati ra, ji tun bɛ jigi ka bɔ kɔda dɔ kɔnɔ Houet kɔda ra.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.914
O kɔ, u y'a fɔ a ye ko: "N'i b'a fɛ k'o kɛ, n' be se k'i yɛrɛ tanga o ma".

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.218
Loon dɔ, dugumɔgɔw ka wagati la, jagokɛla dɔ tun b'a fɛ k'o yɔrɔ sɔrɔ. A ye duvɛn min, ka barika la Ala ye.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.008
O kɔ, a ye dugu dɔ lɔ jii bɔyɔrɔ gɛrɛfɛ min tɔgɔ ko Sya, o kɔrɔ ko Bobo Dioulasso.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:53.482
A dugumɔgɔw tun bɛ to ka na ji min Dafra dugu kɔnɔ, o tun b'a fɛ k'a min. O tun tɛ ɲina jɛgɛw ta baro kɔ fiyewu.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.394
Awa, min tun ye Sya muso dɔ ye, ale ma deen sɔrɔ. A dusu tun man di.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.184
Loon dɔ sɔgɔma, a ye sira ta ka taga n'a ye.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.312
Nka, Dafra dugu kɔrɔsibaga tun b'a kɔnɔna.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.776
Aw ye den dɔ di ne ma.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.080
I ka dajuru ta k'a makɔnɔ.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:40.210
Jigɛ dɔ bɔra jii la. Ala tun y'a daa di koo min na, a sɔnna o ma.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:52.802
Wagati dɔɔni o kɔ, Awa y'a deen lamɔ. A segira ka na Dafra dugu la walisa k'a waleɲumanlɔn.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:15.418
Nka loon dɔ, jɛgɛminɛbaga wɛrɛ nana. A tun b'a ka fɔlikɛminan biri a kamankun kan.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:21.234
Mɔgɔ si tɛ jɛgɛminɛ kɛ yan. O jɛgɛw ka senu.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.914
A yɛlɛla kosɔbɛ. A y'a ka fɔlikɛminan fili ani a ye jigɛ dɔ ta.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.594
O kɔ, a segira ka taga. A kɔ fɛ, sankolo kɛra dibi ye.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:55.360
O kɔ, jii bɔtɔ tora ka sumaya.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:10.466
Nka, u tun b'a fɛ k'o kɛ. O dugumɔgɔw tun be bɔ kɔlɔnw kɔnɔ k'u bololakolon kɔsegi.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.424
O kɔ, jɛgɛminɛbaga dɔ banana.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.688
A yɛrɛyɛrɛtɔ kɔsegira ka na n'o jɛgɛ ye.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:42.274
N'i ka yafa ne ma, garadi. N' tun m'a lɔn.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:48.714
O kɔ, a ye jigɛ nin don jii la. A b'o jɛgɛw balo.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:59.290
O kɔ, jii segira ka na. O dugumɔgɔw nana joona joona walisa k'a ka kɔsegi ɲanagbɛ kɛ.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:22.568
Hali bi, mɔgɔ minw be taga Dafra dugu la, olu b'a to jɛgɛw ye dumuni kɛ.
